* SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
* exec.library, Amiga Exec V39 vector order (NDK exec_lib.fd).
*
* C900 dialect (tools/genlvo.py): an implemented function replaces the
* 68000 register list with its C900 argument types and is followed by its
* return type and, when it is not "x" + its name, "@" and the C function.
* A line that keeps its register list is not implemented: its vector
* raises the AN_BadLVO alert.  exec.library functions take no hidden base
* argument: SysBase is a global.
##base _SysBase
##bias 6
##private
Open(version)(ULONG) struct Library * @kexecopen
Close()() APTR @kexecclose
Expunge()() APTR @knull
Reserved()() APTR @knull
##bias 30
##public
*------ misc ---------------------------------------------------------
Supervisor(userFunction)(a5)
*------ special patchable hooks to internal exec activity ------------
##private
execPrivate1()()
execPrivate2()()
execPrivate3()()
execPrivate4()()
execPrivate5()()
execPrivate6()()
